sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario
    participant Frontend as saduci-platform
    participant Gateway as API Gateway :8000
    participant UserSvc as User Service :8004

    Note over User,Gateway: === Flujo de Login ===
    User->>Frontend: Ingresa credenciales
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /auth/login
    Gateway->>Gateway: Rate limit check (5 req/60s)
    Gateway->>UserSvc: POST /auth/login {username, password}
    UserSvc->>UserSvc: authenticate_user()
    UserSvc-->>Gateway: UserResponse {id, username, email, role}
    Gateway->>Gateway: create_access_token({sub, uid, email, role, is_superuser})
    Gateway-->>Frontend: LoginResponse {access_token, user}
    Frontend->>Frontend: localStorage.setItem("saduci_token", token)
    Frontend-->>User: Sesión iniciada

    Note over User,Gateway: === Hydration de Sesión ===
    Frontend->>Frontend: Al montar, leer token de localStorage
    Frontend->>Gateway: GET /auth/me (Bearer token)
    Gateway->>Gateway: verify_token()
    Gateway->>UserSvc: GET /users/{uid}
    UserSvc-->>Gateway: UserResponse
    Gateway-->>Frontend: UserResponse
    Frontend->>Frontend: AuthProvider actualiza estado

    Note over User,Gateway: === Petición Protegida ===
    User->>Frontend: Crear predicción
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/predictions (Bearer token)
    Gateway->>Gateway: verify_token() + require_especialista_or_admin()
    alt No autorizado
        Gateway-->>Frontend: 403 Forbidden
    else Autorizado
        Gateway->>Gateway: Headers X-User-ID, X-User-Role
        Gateway->>PredSvc: POST /predictions + headers
        PredSvc-->>Gateway: PredictionResponse {user_id, ...}
        Gateway-->>Frontend: Respuesta exitosa
    end
